    "text": "The ratio of maximum acceleration to maximum velocity in a simple harmonic motion is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> At, <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> the displacement is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo></math> What is the maximum acceleration? The initial phase is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> ."
